     6917           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     6918       End.
     6919     End.
     6920     if c-f-rez-cost-pr <>  ?  then do :
     6921       c-f-rez-cost-pr:screen-value = string(f-rez-cost-pr) .
     6922       IF ( line-counter( OutStream )  modulo page-size( OutStream ) = 0 ) AND
     6923           ( line-counter( OutStream ) >= page-size( OutStream ) )          then DO:
     6924           display STREAM OutStream    with frame top-frame .
     6925       End.
     6926     End.
     6927                       display stream OutStream  no-error .
